      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.07,
          "end": 5.36,
          "en": "Now besides mixins as we added them thus far,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.36,
          "end": 7.96,
          "en": "or as we added it thus far,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.96,
          "end": 10.24,
          "en": "which has added locally to a component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.24,
          "end": 12.56,
          "en": "you can also define global mixins,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.56,
          "end": 15.72,
          "en": "which affect all components and not just the components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.72,
          "end": 17.69,
          "en": "where you explicitly add them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.69,
          "end": 21.15,
          "en": "Though to be honest global mixins probably have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.15,
          "end": 23.115,
          "en": "a very limited use case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.115,
          "end": 25.57,
          "en": "Now, one use case could be some logging",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.57,
          "end": 27.58,
          "en": "or analytics functionality,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.58,
          "end": 29.43,
          "en": "which you wanna add to every component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 29.43,
          "end": 32.46,
          "en": "For example, to know when a component was mounted,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 32.46,
          "end": 34.02,
          "en": "anything like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 34.02,
          "end": 39.02,
          "en": "For that we could create a logger.js, mixins file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.16,
          "end": 40.56,
          "en": "in the Mixins folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 40.56,
          "end": 43.96,
          "en": "and in the there, export our mixin object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 43.96,
          "end": 47.18,
          "en": "and in this object now I don't wanna change any data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 47.18,
          "end": 49.666,
          "en": "but instead I'll add the mount that lifecycle hook.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 49.666,
          "end": 52.73,
          "en": "Which of course can be added to any component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 52.73,
          "end": 55.44,
          "en": "and you can also define it in a mixin.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 55.44,
          "end": 56.52,
          "en": "As a side note,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 56.52,
          "end": 59.3,
          "en": "if this mixins would be merged with a component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 59.3,
          "end": 61.83,
          "en": "which also has a mounted lifecycle hook,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 61.83,
          "end": 65.19,
          "en": "both lifecycle hooks would execute the one in the component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 65.19,
          "end": 67.16,
          "en": "and the one in the mixins with the one",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 67.16,
          "end": 69.61,
          "en": "from the component being executed last",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 69.61,
          "end": 72.52,
          "en": "so that it is able to overwrite any changes made",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 72.52,
          "end": 73.53,
          "en": "by to mixin.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 73.53,
          "end": 75.31,
          "en": "But that's just a side note.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 75.31,
          "end": 78.03,
          "en": "Here I'm defining mounted in this mixin",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 78.03,
          "end": 80.08,
          "en": "which I wanna use as a global mixin",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 80.08,
          "end": 83.4,
          "en": "and for the moment I will just log mounted here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 83.4,
          "end": 86.76,
          "en": "So as simply some logging for me as a developer,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 86.76,
          "end": 90.65,
          "en": "maybe you wanna store something in some database here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 90.65,
          "end": 92.18,
          "en": "some analytics data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 92.18,
          "end": 95.003,
          "en": "things like that could be done in a global mixin.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 95.85,
          "end": 97.52000000000001,
          "en": "So here I'm just logging",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 97.52000000000001,
          "end": 100.687,
          "en": "and now we can register this as a global mixin",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 100.687,
          "end": 103.38,
          "en": "by going to our main.js file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 103.38,
          "end": 106.83,
          "en": "where we also defined global components and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 106.83,
          "end": 109.44,
          "en": "Here we can import the logger mixin",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 109.44,
          "end": 113.669,
          "en": "from /mixins/logger.js",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 113.669,
          "end": 115.97999999999999,
          "en": "and with that import that's simply added",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 115.97999999999999,
          "end": 119.95,
          "en": "by calling app.mixin and you probably see a pattern.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 119.95,
          "end": 122.72,
          "en": "We had app component for global components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 122.72,
          "end": 125.84,
          "en": "we have app.mixin for global mixins.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 125.84,
          "end": 130.23,
          "en": "And we simply point at our import here, LoggerMixins.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 131.21,
          "end": 134.37,
          "en": "Now this registers it as a global mixin",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 134.37,
          "end": 136.143,
          "en": "and if we now save that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 137.07,
          "end": 139.5,
          "en": "I get my alerts here, of course still,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 139.5,
          "end": 143.46,
          "en": "but we also now see mounted in the developer tools.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 143.46,
          "end": 147.23,
          "en": "And we see that whenever a component is well mounted",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 147.23,
          "end": 148.063,
          "en": "to the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 148.063,
          "end": 148.89600000000002,
          "en": "So for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 148.89600000000002,
          "end": 150.763,
          "en": "whenever we open a dialogue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 151.93,
          "end": 155.06,
          "en": "And these are global mixins, as I said,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 155.06,
          "end": 157.84,
          "en": "probably a very limited use case",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 157.84,
          "end": 161.99,
          "en": "or a limited number of use cases where they can be useful,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 161.99,
          "end": 164.55,
          "en": "but still something to be aware of in case",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 164.55,
          "end": 167.42000000000002,
          "en": "you have some functionality that should be added",
